mage/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/38002b0e0a5546a463ccee21dc4c4d89?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":35,"num_comments":2,"created_at":"2024-07-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"v0mmp8zjX","title":"How to Embed an SVG in CSS","url":"https://erikarow.land/notes/how-to-embed-svg-in-css","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-embed-an-svg-in-css-v0mmp8zjx","summary":"Learn how to embed an SVG in CSS using data URLs and make them work as background images.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/38002b0e0a5546a463ccee21dc4c4d89?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":7,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-15T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"xTUv971lv","title":"How to Count Unique Lines Using Unix Pipes","url":"https://erikarow.land/notes/count-unique-unix","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-count-unique-lines-using-unix-pipes-xtuv971lv","summary":"Learn how to count unique lines using Unix pipes and standard Unix tools like sort and uniq. The post also discusses the advantages of using long flag names and provides practical applications for the technique.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/38002b0e0a5546a463ccee21dc4c4d89?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":7,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-04-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"4QIHp5ydB","title":"I created a little webring in Gleam","url":"https://erikarow.land/notes/gleam-webring","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/i-created-a-little-webring-in-gleam-4qihp5ydb","summary":"This post discusses the creation of a webring in Gleam and provides insights into how to run a webring service. It also introduces the Constellation project for caching member links.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/38002b0e0a5546a463ccee21dc4c4d89?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":5,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2024-03-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"SroPn9MKe","title":"Embedding Gleam in my blog with Vite","url":"https://erikarow.land/notes/gleam-vite","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/embedding-gleam-in-my-blog-with-vite-sropn9mke","summary":"The post discusses the process of embedding Gleam in a blog using Vite. It covers creating a Lustre project, installing and configuring Vite, using the bundled JavaScript in a static site, and publishing the blog post.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/38002b0e0a5546a463ccee21dc4c4d89?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":15,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2024-01-06T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"e5P5U5SVO","title":"Embedding Gleam in my blog with esgleam","url":"https://erikarow.land/notes/esgleam-embed","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/embedding-gleam-in-my-blog-with-esgleam-e5p5u5svo","summary":"The post discusses the usage of esgleam to bundle and deploy Gleam JavaScript in a project, as well as how to embed the JavaScript in the project.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/38002b0e0a5546a463ccee21dc4c4d89?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-06T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"CC5EpbEsd","title":"Using Regex in Erlang","url":"https://erikarow.land/notes/using-erlang-re","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/using-regex-in-erlang-cc5epbesd","summary":"Learn about using regular expressions in Erlang with the 're' module. Discover how to perform regex matching, handle captures, and compile expressions for efficient reuse.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/38002b0e0a5546a463ccee21dc4c4d89?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-12-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"kKLf1rFwt","title":"Serve a Static Directory with Erlang","url":"https://erikarow.land/notes/erlang-serve-static-directory","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/serve-a-static-directory-with-erlang-kklf1rfwt","summary":"Learn how to serve a static directory using Erlang by configuring the httpd server with the necessary properties.","image":"